      "id": 2,
      "text": "Citrus packing became Weirsdale’s economic backbone after groves sprouted in the 1870s and a railway opened in 1883.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
