      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weirsdale%2C_Florida"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake Weir supplied water for irrigation, fishing, and early steamboat routes, drawing settlers to its eastern shores in the 1850s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
